-6 s clips are fastest and most stable; up to 15 s works for calm scenes.\n\n**Prompt tips for realism**\n- Start with `<Picture 1>`, then say it is real smartphone or handheld footage.\n- Describe one simple action with small natural movements, the light, and the camera (static or slight handheld sway, no cuts, no zoom).\n- Avoid \"cinematic\", \"epic\", \"8k\", \"ultra detailed\".\n- Put speech in quotes after \"Audio:\"."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# MiniMax H3 AI Influencer v2\n\n1. **Your image** is upscaled/restored with SeedVR2 to the chosen resolution and used as the first frame. The video keeps the image's shape (vertical or landscape).\n2. **H3 image-to-video** generates directly at the chosen **RESOLUTION** (short edge): **480**, **720** or **1080**. No video upscaler.\n3. Saved as MP4 with audio.\n\n**Speed**: 480 is fastest, 1080 is slowest. TURBO (8-step LoRA) is much faster with slightly less detail. 5-6 s clips are fastest and most stable; up to 15 s works for calm scenes.\n\n**Prompt tips for realism**\n- Start with `<Picture 1>`, then say it is real smartphone or handheld footage.\n- Describe one simple action with small natural movements, the light, and the camera (static or slight handheld sway, no cuts, no zoom).\n- Avoid \"cinematic\", \"epic\", \"8k\", \"ultra detailed\".\n- Put speech in quotes after \"Audio:\"."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[54,60,0,24,0,"IMAGE"],[55,30,0,26,0,"MODEL"],[56,108,0,27,2,"BOOLEAN"],[57,30,0,27,0,"MODEL"],[58,26,0,27,1,"MODEL"],[59,108,0,28,2,"BOOLEAN"],[60,105,0,28,0,"INT"],[61,113,0,28,1,"INT"],[62,31,0,34,0,"CLIP"],[63,32,0,34,1,"VAE"],[64,60,0,34,2,"IMAGE"],[65,100,0,34,4,"STRING"],[66,120,1,34,5,"INT"],[67,121,1,34,6,"INT"],[68,110,1,34,7,"INT"],[69,106,0,35,0,"INT"],[70,27,0,37,0,"MODEL"],[71,28,0,37,2,"INT"],[72,27,0,38,0,"MODEL"],[73,34,0,38,1,"CONDITIONING"],[74,35,0,39,0,"NOISE"],[75,38,0,39,1,"GUIDER"],[76,36,0,39,2,"SAMPLER"],[77,37,0,39,3,"SIGMAS"],[78,34,1,39,4,"LATENT"],[79,39,